The team notifications PostgreSQL migration requires the `pg_cron` extension to be installed on the target PostgreSQL instance (enable it in `shared_preload_libraries` and run `CREATE EXTENSION pg_cron`) before deploying this version. Galley runs `cron.schedule` for the `expire-team-notifications` garbage-collection job (hourly, deletes rows past their `expires_at`) as part of its schema migrations and fails to boot otherwise.
